
UNDERSTANDING COUNTRYCODE PACKAGE 
library(countrycode)

# the way it works: 
1) specify column you're trying to match, 
2) what kind of data it is (i.e., country.name, iso3c code, etc.. )
3) specify what you want it to be matched with / what you want from the package ("iso3c")

Example: 
df$new_code_column <- countrycode(df$country_name, "country.name", "iso3c") 
